[[File:Malevolence_profile.png|thumb|right|400px|The ''[[Malevolence]]'', a ''Subjugator''-class heavy cruiser]]
'''Heavy cruiser''' was a classification of [[Capital ship|capital]] [[starship]]s that were usually 600 - 1200 [[meter]]s in length<ref name="SWBtCTG">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref> which included vessels such as [[Subjugator-class heavy cruiser|''Subjugator''-class heavy cruisers]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> [[Marsheem-class heavy cruiser|''Marsheem''-class heavy cruisers]],<ref name="TaT P2">{{IDWAdventuresCite-2017|issue=5|story=The Trouble at Tibrin, Part II}}</ref> [[MC85 Star Cruiser]]s,<ref name="TLJ TVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> and [[Maxima-A-class heavy cruiser]]s<ref name="Before">''[[Before the Awakening]]''</ref> The [[Lioaoin Regime]] utilized heavy cruisers.<ref name="Chaos Rising">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Chaos Rising]]''</ref>

